Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:02.94,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,So answer me truthfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:04.80,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.56,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:09.32,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,I know you came to the apartment \Nby yourself yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:14.10,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:19.54,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:23.04,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I formally told her that \NI couldn't go out with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:26.38,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Because I was going to choose Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:29.75,Episode Title,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(481,1)}#9 "It's Been Called Love and Affection"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:34.26,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, if she's missing, let's look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.44,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you use GPS?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:39.97,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,She left without her cell phone \Nand wallet, so we can't track her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:41.43,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Did they just ignore me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:45.05,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Then she probably \Ncouldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:47.55,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,We might be able to find her if we split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:49.74,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You'll all help, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:50.99,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:54.70,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Shidou-san, will you take \Nus closer to the apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.41,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Please get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:02.24,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Those who can't fit in \Nthe car, go with Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:04.71,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Since he seems to know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:09.18,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'll go in the car...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:10.38,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:11.59,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.54,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know you went to her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:18.76,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You said to speed things up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:21.51,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I meant when I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:24.28,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:33.67,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,No comment to the very end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:37.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Do I really matter so little?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:41.28,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! Don't think about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:44.29,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:48.38,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Where did that commando princess go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.59,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,But exactly how are we \Nsupposed to find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:56.40,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have any clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:59.63,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,But in addition to her weak constitution,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.38,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,she doesn't have her wallet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.77,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.69,Italics,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be within walking \Ndistance of the apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:18.03,Italics,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,and somewhere she can stay cool \Nfor free. That's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.41,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I looked around everywhere \Nthat seemed like it'd be cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:27.94,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,but she wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.96,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:31.71,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:35.27,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,No, let's not look in the pond just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:39.08,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'd like to presume \Nthat she's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:43.55,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Then the only place left is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:50.02,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If she's not here, I'm out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:57.61,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.71,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A mirage?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.95,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wait. She's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.83,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.40,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A condescending tone and a flat chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.48,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:18.55,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You thought she might be at school, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.21,0:03:23.34,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:24.97,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:29.00,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She may be aggravating, but it \Nseems we had the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:36.16,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She usually traveled by car,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:40.65,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,so I thought this was about the only place \Nshe could go without really knowing the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:42.78,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it was a miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:46.66,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I went everywhere that had a roof, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:49.91,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Where should we look next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:55.25,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san, I thought you \Ndidn't like Fujinomiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:56.22,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:59.96,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Er, sorry. I was just kinda surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.97,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I didn't think you'd go this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:06.94,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't like her, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.92,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,That perverted catgirl...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:14.49,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,It's just... I feel bad for her \Nsince you rejected her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.82,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Having someone you like look the other way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:21.49,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,is a very sad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:24.09,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,How am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:28.26,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,supposed to take what she just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:33.37,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what you think, \Nwhy do you do that yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:37.47,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You give any guy who tries to get close to \Nyou awful nicknames and push them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:40.65,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think guys don't \Nhave feelings or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.52,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Even for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:47.40,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Suddenly having my feelings \Nthrown back in my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.43,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and then getting them stomped on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:59.66,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,So I just didn't want her to wallow \Nin self-torment about it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:01.90,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.20,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Do you happen to remember \Nthe nickname "Pig's Foot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:15.03,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I want so badly to tell you right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.58,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,that I was the "Pig's Foot"\Nyou rejected that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.47,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Pig's Foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:25.42,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:31.39,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,A paper airplane? Where did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.20,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,The roof...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:43.50,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,After I spotted it in your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.30,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I became curious and had \NShidou purchase them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.03,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I've read volume three so many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:51.54,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:55.72,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,She said that she was reading \N"Rose-eyed Steroid."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:05.51,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It's right around when the heroine gets \Nrejected by her beloved senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.94,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,That scene on the roof was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.95,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,What I have in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:18.94,Flashback Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,are love letters that have \Nlost their destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.78,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Give it up, Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:26.33,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai has someone else he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:31.96,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.22,Flashback Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.06,Flashback,Eiji,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:42.65,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:46.06,Flashback Italics,Momo,0000,0000,0000,,That voice... It couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:50.54,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:59.27,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I had a feeling that you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:06.84,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You mentioned that you \Nliked the rooftop scene
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.15,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,in "Rose-eyed Steroid" volume 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.69,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.61,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have the strength to do \Nthe same thing Momo did, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:23.50,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I think I realize that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:26.71,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Hey—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.97,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right? Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:32.33,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:35.63,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki-san! Contact Shidou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.22,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:42.47,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Why do this to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:53.78,I love you,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:00.44,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:02.66,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Shidou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.20,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,How's Fujinomiya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.84,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to be stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.89,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.42,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,Adagaki Aki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.98,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,Neko-sama would like to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.84,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:19.81,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,She is extremely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.40,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can, please keep it short.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.22,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.02,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,This feels like a final farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.55,Main,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that, Koiwai-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.34,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now. She just said she was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.91,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't wrong, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:44.52,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that my heart wavered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:47.50,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But it didn't feel right, so I pushed her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:53.30,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,For my plan... For my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.68,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I had given her a more \Nfavorable answer in this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.10,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,nothing would've come of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:02.30,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:04.74,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:06.57,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:08.78,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:13.86,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:16.46,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.94,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,What did they talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.58,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can ask \Nher about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:27.29,Fujinomiya Neko,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Fujinomiya Neko
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:25.77,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.50,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Fujinomiya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.18,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's talk about the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:44.89,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:50.07,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Being alive is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:54.49,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I didn't really \Nfeel any discontent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:10:00.28,Seicho,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1236,1)}Seichou Girls' Private Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:09:59.61,Flashback,GirlA,0000,0000,0000,,Fujinomiya-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:58.99,Flashback,GirlB,0000,0000,0000,,Neko-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:00.28,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,Onee-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:04.91,Flashback,GirlA,0000,0000,0000,,That was a lovely student \Ncouncil speech you gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.04,Flashback,GirlB,0000,0000,0000,,I was so moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.03,0:10:08.75,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:13.88,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, Onee-sama... If it's all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:17.59,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,would you like to come to my \Nfamily's villa this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.53,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:21.64,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,It's my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.84,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,If you were to celebrate \Nit with me, I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:28.66,Flashback Italics,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,My kouhai are all so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:32.11,Flashback Italics,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,They're such good girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:34.87,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,If you would have me, I would be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.82,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.17,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,There's a riding ground for \Nhorses and a tennis court,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:42.49,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,so would you like to join \Nme before the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:45.66,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:49.52,Flashback,GirlA,0000,0000,0000,,What are you thinking, asking \NNeko-sama to play tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.56,Flashback,GirlA,0000,0000,0000,,She's so frail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:56.68,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry! I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:58.03,Flashback,GirlB,0000,0000,0000,,It's common knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:01.70,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe you'd try to get closer to \NNeko-sama when you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:03.44,Flashback,GirlC,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:04.92,Flashback,GirlB,0000,0000,0000,,What should you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.32,Flashback,GirlA,0000,0000,0000,,Figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.35,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's fine, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.35,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.70,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,What a silly story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:15.02,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Surgery? Overseas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:16.69,Fujinomiya,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1946,1)}Fujinomiya
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.99,Flashback,Neko's Grandfather,0000,0000,0000,,If nothing is done, your \Ncondition will only worsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.23,Flashback,Neko's Grandfather,0000,0000,0000,,Will you consider trying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:26.37,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,How promising is this prospect?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.13,Flashback,Neko's Grandfather,0000,0000,0000,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:31.77,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,Please forget that I ever mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:37.13,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, Grandfather. \NI don't mind trying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.29,Flashback,Neko's Grandfather,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:43.35,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,But I just have one request...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:44.25,Flashback,Neko's Grandfather,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.92,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:50.78,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,would like to fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.94,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,When this all became a \Nlife-or-death situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:03.95,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,rather than the usual worries or \Nfears most people would have,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:06.94,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I realized that there was no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:16.65,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to experience love, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:22.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,But why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.26,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:28.41,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I just randomly picked your photo \Nout of the mountain of photos
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:30.31,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I had for potential suitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:32.04,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Randomly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:32.99,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:34.28,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Was it a lottery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.69,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,You could call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:38.49,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I never heard anything \Nabout being a potential suitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:40.92,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not uncommon among prestigious families
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:45.20,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,for this to happen to the children,\Nunbeknownst to them, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:50.16,Flashback,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Look, look! Hasn't my \NMaa-kun become so handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.75,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Was it that old hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:58.17,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,If that's why, there's no way we could've \Nfound out anything by researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:01.68,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino-san is very efficient,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:06.15,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,but she couldn't trace the \Nthoughts of a sickly person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.15,0:13:07.67,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:11.24,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So, how did it feel to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:13.48,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:16.58,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,The trial and error was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:21.27,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,and I thought you and I were exactly alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:22.98,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,You and I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:28.38,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. You talk about love and affection \Nfor the purpose of your goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.80,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,but the truth is hidden in fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:34.62,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Shallow and empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:39.70,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, the lie was discovered, \Nand my feelings didn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:46.76,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't have any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:47.85,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:51.10,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I went into everything superficially,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.83,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,but the fluttery feeling of one-sided love...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:56.87,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,The pain of being rejected...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:02.14,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to experience them firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.26,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-sama, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:18.09,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Will you keep walking \Ndown the same path as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.99,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:23.85,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Will you reach the same point I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.85,0:14:24.86,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:26.65,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:35.14,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that is the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.92,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I must say it's rather \Nexhausting to talk this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:42.77,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:47.99,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,When I regain my strength, \NI believe I will be going far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.68,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,So, Masamune-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:56.02,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much for the lovely memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:06.46,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what Masamune-kun and \NFujinomiya-san are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:13.18,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,To tell you the truth, I actually \Nliked Masamune-kun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.17,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:17.89,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:22.40,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really think it wasn't obvious? \NThat's what surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:28.53,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I sometimes think I might \Nregret not telling him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:33.69,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,but I think it was better \Nto keep my feelings inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:36.07,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I'm able to hang out with you all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:39.46,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope that wasn't the \Ncase for Fujinomiya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.04,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:45.25,Italics,Kojuurou,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is it okay that I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:49.51,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-kun likes Adagaki-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:54.18,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how Adagaki-san feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:02.46,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like her stomach's reached its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:03.31,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:06.47,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,She's sad that she has to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.95,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. Yeah, I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:12.14,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Love can be so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.10,Main,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:17.28,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:20.02,Italics,Yoshino,0000,0000,0000,,That might also be the case to some degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:23.37,Main,Tae,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.32,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Makabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:41.12,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,Milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.48,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Shidou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:47.24,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,It appears that your classmates \Nhave left the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:51.10,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thank you for informing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:06.67,Main,Shidou,0000,0000,0000,,I realize I may be out of line,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.75,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,but are you sure you want to let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.22,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.87,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,What Masamune-sama said is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:19.48,Main,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:24.25,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that he made me remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:27.40,Wedding,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(479,1)}Wedding Party
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:28.80,Flashback,Neko's mother,0000,0000,0000,,Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.23,Flashback,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun, we're going to take a picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:33.48,Flashback,Neko's mother,0000,0000,0000,,My, they're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:36.23,Flashback,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,These two sort of look alike, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:39.18,Flashback,Cameraman,0000,0000,0000,,All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:05.98,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you and I were exactly alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:10.86,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,You talk about love and affection \Nfor the purpose of your goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:13.30,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,but the truth is hidden in fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:16.82,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Shallow and empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:21.99,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, the lie was discovered, \Nand my feelings didn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:25.35,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Lies will be discovered...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:27.56,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:33.37,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought something was strange, \Nso I couldn't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:35.88,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,So that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.00,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,what I'll look like in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:45.60,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Will you keep walking \Ndown the same path as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.40,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:49.73,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,What am I so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:52.23,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think about unnecessary things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.98,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to waver now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:57.32,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to make Adagaki Aki look my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:58.98,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:19:01.27,Italics,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'll throw her away in the best way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.25,Main,Narino,0000,0000,0000,,Are you heading out, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:17.03,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just going out to the garden. \NI'm not going outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:19.18,Main,Narino,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.85,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,That should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:31.44,Flashback,,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop trying to act so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.52,Flashback,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:37.40,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,As you can see, I was completely \Nand utterly rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:41.59,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune-sama is a sincere person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:46.22,Flashback,Neko,0000,0000,0000,,What reason could you have \Nto deny his love for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:52.79,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Love? It's not like love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.41,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:01.76,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,The Commando Catgirl thing was a mistake, \Nand there's no reason to get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:05.66,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,So... should I like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.18,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.48,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, no! That's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:16.73,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's Makabe! That \Nthoughtless, stupid man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:20.65,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,He says whatever sounds good \Nwhenever he opens his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:24.70,Flashback,Young aki,0000,0000,0000,,You're so pathetic, Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:27.23,Flashback,Young Aki,0000,0000,0000,,You need to straighten up more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:30.25,Flashback,Young Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I can't, Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:32.47,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:37.45,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to call something \N"love," that was love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:40.40,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Those chubby little cheeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.81,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,his tummy that had rolls worth tugging on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.15,Italics,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,He was so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.14,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:57.86,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun! Maa-kun's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.82,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,What? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.44,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun's saying he's going to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:07.45,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like that one song!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.31,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,You're overreacting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:12.34,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he's just off to train \Nby going jogging again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.04,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:17.59,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to retrain myself since \NI became naïve at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:20.39,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to carry out my original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.53,Main,Chinatsu,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.63,Main,Kinue,0000,0000,0000,,Sniffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:27.07,Main,Masamune,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to get rid of any unneeded fat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:30.73,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,and build up some new muscles \Nand ways of being hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:44.31,Main,Gasou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.31,0:21:45.22,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
