Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.86,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Could you actually be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:01.13,Main,Aki,0000,0000,0000,,Masamune?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:05.13,Main,Gasou,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's been a while, Aki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.06,Main,Gasou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
